--! A test platform's one capability: make every later directory listing
--! fail with an error code of the caller's choosing, to reach the failures
--! `Io.readDir` names that no program can arrange by itself (`EACCES` when
--! the tests run as root, `EMFILE`) and the one it does not (`EIO`).

--| From now on, every `fs.promises.readdir` rejects with an error whose
--| `code` is the given one.
pub foreign impure failListings : String → ⊤
